``` Run each search separately in the historical training dataset.
Adapted from original investigation notes; not rerun for this portfolio. ```

``` Review Cerber alert signatures and their observed frequency. ```
index=client1 sourcetype="suricata" "cerber"
| stats count by alert.signature, alert.signature_id
| sort count

``` Separate search: inspect registry evidence of file-share connections.
Registry artifacts are leads and do not prove current connectivity. ```
index=client1 host="we8105desk" sourcetype="WinRegistry" fileshare

``` Separate search: count distinct PDF paths in the relevant server events.
This counts file activity; it does not independently prove encryption. ```
index=client1 host="we9041srv" app="win:unknown"
| where like(lower(Relative_Target_Name), "%.pdf")
| stats dc(Relative_Target_Name) as distinct_pdf_paths
